  "_readme": "Mirror of the Paddle catalogue (the app repo's scripts/paddle_catalogue.py creates it and writes the ids to scripts/paddle_ids.<env>.json). For each price: paste its Paddle product ID (pro_...) and price ID (pri_...), keep amount and currency exactly as in Paddle, then run `pnpm check:prices` to confirm every place the site shows that price says the same. sku matches custom_data.sku in Paddle. Prices for other countries are Paddle overrides and are not shown on the site. Retail plans are not sold through Paddle: they are invoiced directly after a pilot, so they are not here.",
